@{h1}Example - Hello world

Create a file called hello.znc and add the following content

make dot "/dot/hello";
puts("Hello World");

Next, compile and assemble the code

.znc hello.znc
.asm hello.asm

If you did not get any errors with the above, you can excute the program and you 
should see Hello World printed to the screen.
